    "System.Description": "\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb\u003ECenário Atual:\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cspan\u003EAtualmente os clientes TIM não conseguem resetar a senha diretamente pela página da companhia aérea, pois é exibido uma mensagem orientativa para realizar um passo a passo através do MEU TIM, Desta forma, a jornada inicial é interrompida p/ o cliente iniciar uma nova jornada através do MeuTIM, resultando em uma experiência ruim p/ o cliente.\u003C/span\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cspan\u003E\u003Cb\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/span\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cspan\u003E\u003Cb\u003ECenário Desejado:\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EDesejamos alterar a atual mensagem e direcionar o cliente para a página de reset de senha, sem precisar acessar o APP Meu TIM (à exemplo da Jornada informada nesse briefing - não é jornada definitiva). \u003Cu\u003E\u003Cb\u003EPrecisamos que TI defina a melhor solução.\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/u\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cspan\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003EFeature 1 - Alteração da Fraseologia e Criação do Botão&nbsp;\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cb\u003ECenário atual: \u003C/b\u003Ea parte de “Esqueci minha senha” está apenas orientativo.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"font-weight:bold;\"\u003ECenário desejado: \u003C/span\u003EQue seja inserido um \u003Cb\u003Ebotão que leve para a página de reset de senha da TIM (Webview)\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cb\u003E\u003Cspan\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/span\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://dev.azure.com/timbrasil/8ceb2458-7571-460e-876c-10a717558e26/_apis/wit/attachments/563d291a-5871-47d5-83f0-8dc0e0e7db9d?fileName=%7bE3213CC4-16A4-4247-ABCB-25AC79F077C5%7d.png\" alt=Image style=\"width:1132px;\" width=1132 height=402\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"\u003EFeature 2 - Integração\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"box-sizing:border-box;\"\u003EPrecisamos que a página de de reset de senha seja integrada ao sistema da Intelsat, e que seja possível trafegar e resetar a senha através da Webview.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003EAbaixo segue a URL utilizada pelo APP Beta para Reset de senha, porém, \u003Cb\u003E\u003Cu\u003ETI precisa nos informar qual será o melhor caminho\u003C/u\u003E\u003C/b\u003E.:&nbsp;&nbsp; \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003Ehttps://auth3.tim.com.br/webapp-resetSenha/forgotPassword?layout=meutimapp&amp;loginType=USER&amp;channel=4&amp;msisdn=\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 0);\"\u003EDD\u003C/span\u003E%”\u003Cspan style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 0);\"\u003EMSISDN\u003C/span\u003E” \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cb\u003E\u003Cspan\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/span\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E\u003Cdiv\u003E\u003Cb style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;font-size:14.6667px;\"\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/b\u003E \u003C/div\u003E",
